{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0372321904e769418fc9f8296401c45152ab41e7cf512c422999be5c96c4ee5f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70de0da67222c155d68ca7ce662d0805374f6d287fbf73f418428b4c760b752d",
      "text": "你好，●●●●プロデューサー。\n前几天的演唱会辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c06ed7dc1f0cc2e0ec3e3b4b827052530c4c6ec830d74a20492b4a0f4b92be98",
      "text": "那个时候，我发现在观众席里\n有着从961 Pro时代就陪伴至今的天使酱们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cdec7106baf3c7e3b46b0ea320f4f511bc41a74bfcb98ad549d83106b0149ed",
      "text": "于是，我就重读了至今为止收到的粉丝信。\n也借此回顾了当年的时光呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2477e63017f465252050f6ced2e4fcb663dc1a900ed71b6cd0e44aaf969c7e9",
      "text": "这次不是作为Jupiter，而是作为315 Production的\n代表去完成工作，让我明白了一件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:105e8f8ba13cb7c2e61d49de62961e81a29058d09e36c5b182aacb06fa90db8d",
      "text": "那就是直到现在，我们依然能够回应\n从过去就一直支持着我们的粉丝的期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:256f69bf9039fe3e8401d11ef4647f331c69d3410353ffe4121d696686fc8b31",
      "text": "那是一场能感受到热情\n的演唱会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e749d538080c02cd555a91515cdec521c5ecfbd7e36975ac09b8ec509224e6dd",
      "text": "因为北斗先生的魅力日复一日\n在增加啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c751a9f607110aeed579fbb2ea2a0e6c90feb8b4ccaf266f7f97d28e4f6ca7e",
      "text": "如果那份热量传达到了观众席的话，\n或许作为代表的职责就算圆满完成了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:414b8257dce3c668021e2073b1058b2ee4bd4b2830ff615f19e295d4df0884b1",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢。如果在制作人眼中\n我也显得充满魅力的话，那就再好不过了☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65462cd9496c7e81171af1b5a7b4ca64b1ae39809d1376100fc8daf0d0cced3d",
      "text": "对于为我创造了意识到这一点的契机的你，\n我唯有感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_402_2_4_003_02_09_a:2_4_003_02_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fff5abea5397a18726b1942771f792f9ed96819c776bf9179d6f3a54e16d7530",
      "text": "真的非常感谢你。今后也请多多关照我……\n多多关照我们。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
